# shell/mesh-guard.zsh — redirects `claude` to your identity repo when
# invoked from any "mesh" repo so that PROJECT_STATUS.md / memory load.
#
# Activation:
#   1. Define mesh repo paths in shell/mesh-repos.list (one path per line)
#   2. Source this file from shell/aliases.sh (the template does it)
#   3. Forks without mesh-repos.list → mesh-guard becomes a no-op
#
# Override: `claude --here` runs without redirect prompt.
#
# Copy from mesh-workstation/template/shell/mesh-guard.zsh.example
# and customize, or use the identity's version directly.
